OL,6,G     Prisons
OL,7,     FNew Bilibid Prison is one of the
OL,8,     Fmost notorious prisons in the
OL,9,     FPhilippines. Originally designed
OL,10,     Fto hold 1500 offenders, there are
OL,11,     Fnow more than 8000 incarcerated
