OL,16,     FTanami with a trailer load of
OL,17,     Ftrouble, and it's a wild ride for
OL,18,     FNigel Vagg hauling 900 feral goats
OL,19,     Fthrough a heatwave.
OL,20,G0225 Trucking Hell
